---
// Case study illustration (/des-sys-audit, Implementation step): the two ways a finding got shipped.
// Token-only changes became my own PR. Deeper causes went to a developer with a note; the example is
// a pagination input whose empty div below the field, probably there for validation messages, pushes
// it out of line with the arrows and labels. Rendered in HTML with role tokens so it follows
// the colour mode. The PR title and validation message are illustrative.
---

<div class="impl">
  <div class="impl-path">
    <strong class="impl-title">Token adjustments: Open my own PR</strong>
    <div class="impl-pr">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="18" cy="18" r="3"></circle>
        <circle cx="6" cy="6" r="3"></circle>
        <path d="M13 6h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v7M6 9v12"></path>
      </svg>
      <span>Checkbox: align text tokens with design</span>
      <span class="tag">Token-only</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <span class="impl-or">or</span>

  <div class="impl-path">
    <strong class="impl-title">Requiring further investigation: Developer Handoff</strong>

    <div class="impl-stage">
      <span class="impl-stage-label">Pagination: the input sits higher than the arrows and labels</span>
      <div class="impl-pagination">
        <span class="impl-page-link">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 6l-6 6 6 6"></path></svg>
          Previous
        </span>
        <span class="impl-input">
          <span class="impl-field">3</span>
          <span class="impl-reserve"></span>
          <span class="impl-badge">Empty div</span>
        </span>
        <span class="impl-page-link">
          Next
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="impl-line"></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="impl-why">
      <span class="impl-stage-label">The input field includes an empty div, probably meant to house the validation message</span>
      <div class="impl-why-cols">
        <div class="impl-why-col">
          <span class="impl-why-name">In a form</span>
          <span class="impl-input">
            <span class="impl-field"></span>
            <span class="impl-message">Enter a valid number</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="impl-why-col">
          <span class="impl-why-name">In pagination</span>
          <span class="impl-input">
            <span class="impl-field">3</span>
            <span class="impl-reserve"></span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="impl-note">
      <span class="impl-kicker">Note to developer</span>
      <span>Worth investigating in the input field, or not worth touching because of technical constraints?</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .impl {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .impl-or {
    justify-self: center;
    font: var(--type-label);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-body);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .impl-path {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
    background: var(--color-canvas);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-base);
    font: var(--type-compact);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-body);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .impl-title {
    font: var(--type-label);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-body);
  }

  .impl-kicker,
  .impl-stage-label,
  .impl-why-name {
    color: var(--color-subtle);
  }

  .impl-pr {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2) var(--space-3);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-base);
  }

  .impl-pr svg {
    flex: none;
    width: var(--space-5);
    height: var(--space-5);
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-success);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .impl-pr > span:first-of-type {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .impl-stage,
  .impl-why {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  /* Centred in a row, the input's extra height pushes its field above the row's centre line */
  .impl-pagination {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-10);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-base);
  }

  /* Above the centre line, so it breaks around the labels instead of striking through them */
  .impl-page-link {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-1);
    padding-inline: var(--space-1);
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .impl-page-link svg {
    flex: none;
    width: var(--space-4);
    height: var(--space-4);
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .impl-input {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    justify-items: stretch;
    width: var(--space-16);
  }

  .impl-why-col .impl-input {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: calc(var(--space-24) * 2);
  }

  .impl-field {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    height: var(--space-8);
    background: var(--color-canvas);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-base);
  }

  /* The empty div, hatched in Inspect mode's measurement colour */
  .impl-reserve {
    height: var(--space-5);
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      -45deg,
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-measure) 40%, transparent) 0 2px,
      transparent 2px 6px
    );
  }

  .impl-message {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: var(--space-5);
    font: var(--type-count);
    color: var(--color-danger);
  }

  .impl-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: calc(100% + var(--space-1));
    left: 50%;
    padding: var(--space-inset) var(--space-1);
    border-radius: var(--radius-base);
    background: var(--color-measure);
    color: var(--color-on-measure);
    font: var(--type-count);
    white-space: nowrap;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  /* The centre line the arrows and labels share, placed by the row's own padding */
  .impl-line {
    position: absolute;
    top: calc(50% - var(--space-3));
    right: var(--space-4);
    left: var(--space-4);
    border-top: 2px dotted var(--color-danger);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .impl-why-cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .impl-why-col {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-base);
  }

  .impl-note {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-1);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-base);
  }
</style>
